---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { siteRanges } from '../../data/siteRanges';
---
<BaseLayout title="2026 product & price catalogue | Flowin" description="Open the official Flowin 2026 product and price list. Jump to uPVC, cPVC, SWR or agriculture catalogue sections."><SiteHeader /><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="wrap simple-hero"><p class="kicker">The complete product reference</p><h1>The 2026 catalogue.<br />Always within reach.</h1><p>Keep the product families, sizes, packing and printed rates together. Open the full PDF or start with a range.</p></section><section class="wrap catalogue-content"><div class="catalogue-cover"><img src="/images/flowin-product-group-legacy.jpg" alt="Flowin legacy product assortment" width="500" height="500" /><h2>Flowin pipes<br />&amp; fittings</h2><p>Official 2026 product &amp; price list</p><a class="solid-btn" href="/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open complete catalogue ↗</a><a class="footer-catalogue" href="/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf" download>Download PDF</a></div><div class="catalogue-index"><h2>Go straight to a range.</h2>{siteRanges.map(r => <a href={`/catalogue/flowin-price-list-2026.pdf#page=${r.sourcePage}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><strong>{r.name}</strong><small>Open the catalogue section at PDF page {r.sourcePage}</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}<p>Rates are the printed 2026 catalogue reference. Confirm current commercial terms and availability when making an enquiry. Blank cells on the website remain blank where the catalogue provides no value.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Browse web product tables</a></div></section></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
